        {
          "id": "efd1f903-bcc2-3ff9-92fe-54df9f3dd9c6",
          "content": {
            "id": "efd1f903-bcc2-3ff9-92fe-54df9f3dd9c6",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "3 Things: Defense stocks, China trade, Tether",
            "description": "<p>European defense stocks rose (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SAAB-B.ST\">SAAB-B.ST</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BA.L\">BA.L</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RHM.DE\">RHM.DE</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HO.PA\">HO.PA</a>) after President Trumps shift in policy towards Ukraine. In a move that could appease U.S trade negotiators, China says it will forego asking for benefits it gains from its status as a developing country from the WTO. Tether, the issuer of the world's largest stablecoin is in talks with investors to raise $20 billion. This deal would give the company a valuation of $500 billion - making it one of the world's most valuable private firms. For more live coverage of markets watch the full episode of<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cLr6hc2-oMY&list=PLx28zU8ctIRqTE7Y4uXTY-S2oHlwDsL5c\"> Market Sunrise</a> and head to<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/\"> Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "European defense stocks rose (SAAB-B.ST, BA.L, RHM.DE, HO.PA) after President Trumps shift in policy towards Ukraine. In a move that could appease U.S trade negotiators, China says it will forego asking for benefits it gains from its status as a developing country from the WTO. Tether, the issuer of the world's largest stablecoin is in talks with investors to raise $20 billion. This deal would give the company a valuation of $500 billion - making it one of the world's most valuable private firms. For more live coverage of markets watch the full episode of Market Sunrise and head to Yahoo Finance.",
